WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.839
♪

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:06.589
Russ: Dad,

00:00:06.589 --> 00:00:08.883
you’re gonna take us on one of your expeditions, right?

00:00:08.883 --> 00:00:10.760
Yeah, where are we going this year?

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.888
We might have to postpone our normal summer travel.

00:00:13.888 --> 00:00:16.141
I’m sorry, I’m on a hard deadline

00:00:16.141 --> 00:00:17.809
Alex: and I really need to work alone.

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:21.938
♪

00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:22.564
Russ: Dad?

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:23.523
Sky: Alex?

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.024
Russ: He’s not in here.

00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:29.696
♪

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:30.697
Wow!

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:32.574
Did you know this was here, mom?

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:35.952
♪

00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:38.747
[TELEPHONE RINGING]

00:00:38.747 --> 00:00:40.039
Dad!

00:00:40.039 --> 00:00:48.089
♪

00:00:48.089 --> 00:00:49.215
[SCREAMING]

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:50.175
♪

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:51.426
Dad?

00:00:51.426 --> 00:00:52.677
Dad turned to stone?

00:00:52.677 --> 00:00:54.471
♪

00:00:54.471 --> 00:00:56.306
Pandora: Our ancestors stole these artifacts…

00:00:56.848 --> 00:00:57.974
Pandora: and cursed the family.

00:00:57.974 --> 00:01:00.810
♪

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:02.562
Sky: We need to return the artifacts to

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:03.396
Sky: where they belong.

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:04.439
♪

00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:05.648
Pandora: If we do that…

00:01:05.648 --> 00:01:06.775
Russ: We could get dad back!

00:01:06.775 --> 00:01:10.779
♪

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:12.947
Pandora: But the only way we’ll be able to do this…

00:01:12.947 --> 00:01:15.992
♪

00:01:15.992 --> 00:01:17.243
Pandora: Is as a family.

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:30.089
♪

